=== Multi-Dimensional Array Comprehensive Test ===

1. Basic multi-dimensional arrays:
  matrix[1,1] = a
  matrix[2,2] = d

2. Three-dimensional arrays:
  cube[1,2,3] = xyz
  cube[2,3,4] = abc

3. String indices in multi-dimensional arrays:
  data[user1,age] = 25
  data[user1,name] = Alice
  data[user2,name] = Bob

4. Membership testing:
  (1,1) is in matrix
  (3,3) is NOT in matrix
  (user1,age) is in data

5. Deleting elements:
  Before delete: matrix[1,1] = a
  After delete: matrix[1,1] is gone

6. SUBSEP variable:
  Default SUBSEP length: 1
  Explicit key (2 SUBSEP 2): 22
  matrix[key] = d

  With SUBSEP=':', arr2[1,2] = colon-separated
  Key is: 1:2

7. Iteration over multi-dimensional array:
  key: 1\0341 => value: NW
  key: 1\0342 => value: NE
  key: 2\0341 => value: SW
  key: 2\0342 => value: SE

8. Using arrays as sets with delete:
  Initial:
    a
    b
    c
  After deleting 'b':
    a
    c

9. Mixed single and multi-dimensional:
  mixed[1] = single
  mixed[1,2] = double
  mixed[1,2,3] = triple
  1 is in mixed
  (1,2) is in mixed
  (1,2,3) is in mixed
